hyder e karbala, saqeey e bawafa, afzalushohda<br>
<br>
1.abbas shujaat hai , abbas wafa hai,<br>
saqay e sakina hai , zainab ki rida hai,<br>
abbas fatima aur , hyder ki dua hai.<br>
<br>
2.tum jaa rahe ho bhai , bhai ko chord kar,<br>
kya hoga bibiyon ka , tujhko nahi khaber,<br>
kat jayega mera sar , lut jayega yeh ghar.<br>
<br>
3.baba ne jo khuda se , maanga who mil gaya,<br>
meri madad ko aye , tum aaj karbala,<br>
abbas tumnay mujhsay , wada wafa kiya.<br>
<br>
4.aye qhaak e karbala tu , kharon ko hataade,<br>
abbas gir raha hai , kaanton ko hataade,<br>
so jae woh sukoo se , teeron ko hataade.<br>
<br>
5.pyason main aik pyasa , abbas tu raha,<br>
nehr e furat par bhi , pyasa hi reh gaya,<br>
asghar ko yaad karkay , pani nahi piya.<br>
<br>
6. binayi kho gayi hai , kham hai meri kamar<br>
uthkar mai girr raha hoon , karbal ki zami par,<br>
tashna labi se mera , patta hai abb jigar.<br>
<br>
7.thame hue kamar ko , jab ran mein agaya,<br>
ek so pade they bazu , ek so alam tera,<br>
ek aank bhi thi zakhmi , maatha bhi khoo bhara.<br>
<br>
8.aqa kaha hai tumne , bachpan se hamesha,<br>
bhai hoon par mujhe tum , kehte rahe moula,<br>
bhai kaho bhai ko , bas hai ye tamanna.<br>
<br>
9.tumne toh jung meri , dekhi nahi abhi,<br>
asghar ka khoo bahega , sooncha nahi kabhi,<br>
bazaar mein phireingay, ahle haram sabhi.<br>
<br>
10. kehti hai ye sakina , aye sher e bawafa,<br>
aajaiye cha cha jaa , kyun humse ho khafa,<br>
maangongi na mai paani , kitni bhi ho jafa.<br>
<br>
11. zainab rabab o laila , kulsum o sakina,<br>
gash main hai ali akber , ka dekh ke sina,<br>
marne se tere bibi , mar jaye kahi na.<br>
<br>
12.mayusi cha gayi hai , sab kheimagah mein,<br>
umeed abb rahi na , pyason ki aah mein,<br>
ek aasera tumhi ho , sab ki nigaah mein.<br>
<br>
13.ghamkhar hai na yawar , tanha hai abb hussain,<br>
talwaron main gira hai , zahra ka noor e ain,<br>
tere baghair bhai , dil ko nahi hai chain.<br>
<br>
14.shabbir alqama per , karte hai yeh buka,<br>
bazu jari ka lekar , deta hai ye sada ,<br>
yeh aqtari ka nauha , pardtay raho raza.